  "job_B15.8.572_20251003_114346": {
    "text": "This beo\u00fe \u00f0a land ymere \u00f0e Wlfrun hafa\u00fe, don into \u00f0a mynstre in Hamtune, & \u00f0e tune nome \u00f0e \u00f0is\nErest of Earnleie, & Espich, & Bilsetnatun, & Willenhale, & Wodnesfeld, & Weoleshale, & Ocgintun, &\nThis beo\u00fe \u00f0a mere into Earnleie.\nErest of Earesbroce & \u00f0a scorte \u00f0ornes & of \u00f0a scorte \u00f0ornes in Wlsieshorsecroft & \u00f0anen in\n& of \u00f0e scagan in Eadulfescrofte, & of \u00f0a crofte in \u00f0one ryewei, onlang \u00f0ane riewei in \u00f0a eordbriche, &\n& of \u00f0a sea\u00fee in Heortseges broc, onlang \u00f0es broces in \u00f0a my\u00fean, & of \u00f0are my\u00feen in Byinnigbroc.\n& \u00f0anen up efter broce in \u00f0at sych, & of \u00f0an sich in Sciteresford, & of \u00f0an forde in Bromescumbe, & of\nOnlang Sefernes in fif aken, of fif aken in \u00f0one styb, & of \u00f0a stibbe in \u00f0a strete, onlang strete in winnan\nOnlang beches in Seferne, up efter Seferne in Leofrichesymere, onlang \u00f0e mere in Thurulfesweie, of \u00f0e\n& of \u00f0e leie on Earesbroc \u00f0er hit er on feng, & ouer Fatestal into Earnleie et \u00f0ere wich, and \u00f0ritti\nThis beo\u00fe \u00f0e land ymere into Eiswich.\nErest of ebles bece in \u00f0a dic, & of \u00f0a dice on Sture dun efter into Tresel, up efter Tresel in\n& of \u00f0a forde on \u00f0at sic, onlang sices upward in Belstowe, & of Belstowa in Tresel.\nThis beo\u00fe \u00f0e mere to Bilsetnetun, & to Wodnesfeld & erest of Hindebroce in \u00f0eo dic bitwonem\nOnlang \u00f0a dic forte cume \u00f0er, \u00f0eo dic went estward, & of \u00f0am dice for\u00fe on \u00f0one \u00f0orne \u00f0ar \u00fea \u00f0reo\n& of \u00f0am \u00f0ore in \u00feone lece mere, & of \u00fea mere on \u00feone ford \u00feer beorgi\u00fees sanes strete li\u00fe ofer, & of \u00fea\n& nor\u00feward ford efter dic \u00feet on piates \u00feorn, and of \u00fee \u00feorne efter \u00feere dic on Penwie \u00feer\n& for\u00fe onlang penwies in Byribroc & of \u00fea broce \u00feat on \u00feone Ealrescagen, & efter Ealrescagan on \u00feat\n& of \u00fea stane on \u00fea suinsete, & of \u00feare suinsete onlang strete hat on \u00feara dic, onlang dic \u00feet on\n& efter sic on \u00feone broc in Beadgi\u00feeburne, & of \u00fea burne into landebroce onlang \u00fees broces on\nThis beo\u00fe \u00fea land ymere betuone Kinpaldestune & Eatuue.\nErest of \u00fea broce on \u00fean heafdan on \u00feone dic, onlang dices in \u00feono\u00feorne broce, \u00e6fter \u00fean broce into\nOnlang dic into Sealtmere, \u00feer ofer \u00feone mere on \u00fea dic, efter \u00feere dic wi\u00fe easten ryecroft on \u00feone fule\nThis is \u00feo ymere into Hage\u00feorndune.\nErest of Searesbrocesforde on Holeweie, & of \u00fean weie on \u00feat longa strete, & of \u00feare strete on \u00feone\nAnlang Heies on \u00fereo ymere, & of \u00fereo ymere on E\u00feelwier heie on \u00feone feld on \u00feone Ihau, & \u00feanen on\nOnlang sledes op on ea & \u00feat eastward on \u00feat o\u00feer sled, efter \u00fea slede on \u00fe\u00e6t white stanas, & \u00fear on \u00fea\nEfter strete in \u00feat white sic, efter \u00fea sice on \u00feone whiten halh, and \u00feer on \u00feene broc, onlang broces \u00feat\nThis beo\u00fe \u00f0a land ymere at Hiltune & at Feo\u00feerestane.\nErest of Brenesfopde onlan \u00f0a strete on Lece broc, upward efter broce on \u00f0ana Stanieford, efter \u00f0are\nFor\u00fe efter his hagan heies \u00f0at hit cume on \u00f0ane michelemor, and \u00f0onen on \u00f0a ealdan byri, & \u00f0anen on\n& \u00f0anen on \u00f0a hyll, & of \u00f0a hille on \u00f0a heafdan, for\u00fe efter \u00f0e heafdan on \u00f0one o\u00feerne hil, onlang hilles\n& of \u00f0ane stane \u00f0uers ofer \u00f0one mor in Ebroc, onlang broces in Brunesford \u00f0er hit er of eode.\nThis beo\u00fe \u00f0a land ymere into Ogintune.\nErest on \u00f0a greata alres, efter \u00f0a more on Wassawillan, of \u00f0a on \u00f0e dic, efter \u00f0are dic on \u00f0at fen, et hare\nEfter \u00fean heie \u00feet for\u00fe richte on blaca leige, on sa leie su\u00fe forte eft on \u00fee efter strete on \u00feane ford, efter\nEfter heredic \u00f0et on \u00fees ford on \u00feone broc, efter broce ongea streame \u00feat on ge stret efter strete \u00feat on\nThis beo\u00fe \u00f0a land ymere into Weoleshale, erest on Weolesford.\nOf Weolesford, efter broce ongean streame \u00feat on myclan mor, & \u00f0an more \u00feat on rye halan, & of rye\n\u00de\u00e6t on efter dice \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00fea haran wi\u00fei, of \u00fean wi\u00fei \u00feat on heortsole, of heortsole on Hunten stye, of\nOf \u00feel forde efter mid streame \u00feet on Ordeiseie, on \u00fean broce, efter broce ongean streame west on",
